The max (safe) enchantment for *ALL* weapons in nethack and [s] is +7.
However, if you are prepared to vapourise a large proportion of your
weapons and have a sufficient supply of EW scrolls to hand (polypile
for them), there's nothing to stop you getting +8, +9 or even higher.

To get big stacks of daggers to enchant, remember you can #dip orcish
daggers into !oGL (which can be alchemised) for normal daggers, and
#dip normal daggers for (dark|regular) elven daggers.

Slashem is great for this kind of munchkinism. Pudding farming might
be nerfed, but there's always reverse-geno and create monster. The
"polied items revert back" thing is so easy to circumnavigate it can
actually be used make polypiling easier.
In my last game (wishless) I was running about with well over 30 +9
elven daggers, a +9 Helm of brilliance and Anhur knows what else
before even visiting the castle. Died YASD to a basilisk corpse
(d'oh!), but my next game I intend to achieve even stupider levels of
over-enchantment and not die. Once I've posted my wishless, genoless
YAFAP in a full set of +9 armour, I'll post a "powergaming for
slashem" spoiler of some kind.



